      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1839, Chief Cloud Man moved his Mdewakanton Sioux band to Oak Grove, a site that later became the Oak Grove Mission built by missionary Gideon Hollister Pond.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
