      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bloomington Ice Garden hosts three rinks, including an Olympic‑size arena that once welcomed the 1998 Winter Olympics training sessions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloomington%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Metropolitan Stadium, originally built for the Minneapolis Millers, was later expanded to host Major League Baseball and the NFL’s Minnesota Vikings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
